# OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application) from console.cloud.google.com's
# "APIs & Services > Credentials" — enables the "Sign in with Google" button
# on the login screen. Must be the SAME client ID as the backend's
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (backend/.env.example). Leave unset to hide the button
# entirely — password login always works regardless.
#
# Baked in at build time (Vite convention) — changing it requires a rebuild,
# not just a redeploy.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
